msgid "{count, plural, one {# member has a tag that is already taken} other {# members have a tag that is already taken}}"
msgstr "{count, plural, zero {# dalībniekiem ir jau aizņemta birka} one {# dalībniekam ir jau aizņemta birka} other {# dalībniekiem ir jau aizņemta birka}}"

